1f01cbde-6d28-801b-a58e-c38316c6c23e	Philosophy Column: What is Love?	philosophy-column-what-is-love	["Camilla Fezzi"]	["Column"]	2025-05-13 14:00:00+00	\N	\nWhat is Love?\n\n\nLove in the Quiet Hours: Reflections from the Windowsill at Caltech\n\n\n[link_preview](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nSGUGNEc97NCqtGDnRVYL71Taty2gxRmHfrheOLbkpw/edit?tab=t.0)\n\n\n[what_is_love.docx](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/c265dfb9-8ac9-4320-8eb7-2a303d3ca597/174bfb16-f352-4047-a0a3-a59d5e8001d9/what_is_love.docx?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466XJUW6GG5%2F20251109%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20251109T045627Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEBsaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJIMEYCIQCEKEVQ3lY2wY6aMiI%2B1ztafP7jUe7eDBzi7Kvz9T4XHwIhAPgPsGEAIHOcYEbHUy9%2FmwPjlKYSUY7Pf6UcvB3ezZ4tKogECOT%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEQABoMNjM3NDIzMTgzODA1IgyuxtiaSrsbnW%2BD7hgq3APwq5lhFGSH%2FfUwf0%2FbfxP8vp0QyMXv4FsBG6huoMYIe64Mswmg6T6HZPEg%2BspjerG1xy1ObFwx4Z2asCgZ7dtRztX31AayFeEHdhrc0b2uV7OzcOSFw2U4lRXpVNE5dMtl1iPN4kk429pVF9YD6pC28wGwhShBkGJ0ybKTDb%2FjBQpqcJTijLKYOIELtpXWuEhiwg2Fj2L9zko89FTSgbjNJWQQeEdvjf6RbxJ8OewjlUOC8RnC7WHi8dF%2BBBkP%2Bzx8G46FkgJkEwsJ%2B7r%2F3jEt%2FPTlYqMBwiTXUvu2qibCQzvg8x%2BmCL8cik4RKIJMixs4Ca1ht969I3rJwkbET8lcDPwg36Y6PkHo0ypOMoc0F0TB%2BQoV495ePUkad0YYnRgBaML5pz3fMbvum6iROOI6b%2FyxkYW4%2FVM4%2BSLJoPHo0gpip1N7A%2BVwqO6%2BmuywI6oDaSLxZPdUvd%2BjY1Lh5MdrawelCN6UpoaMRbn9dHC9Bqd1HcQ%2FlKx1dsdCxefCEbvBfpymGyZuXDuINq3NJZoSFXZGMDwee4KwMmG8m7uZ7z2ScRU6LnvXxl%2BxMSjhxFASLDU%2BXBOOQdfw441L7%2F3CT4C6ypEYePewgOj2wF75iRg9MDNn0tcN7s5UZTDDg8DIBjqkAepAJlFHdVcKYXq8SZONGR96OEQRPiwCaZ10Zx%2F0Os%2FlxKWmkKbq0%2FxHzns9JlYCrgvnReuCzn5wC%2FBrZXsoQLyRJdFZfo8Vl0lmsPrjqLsjRAs5K2KmECHi%2B9ucO9s%2B30pbEwfK1XHdoVjYMjmODQMyT6mcptCU%2BFf0VBH50DaCMumXPr5yM3FB0AzApRSuRxznL8%2BLgmp66S%2FZ1XvsCo1MULxf&X-Amz-Signature=27effaab5a458a8c3fd46c0a13a409c88f3b5802a503a8f27ccbbd43512946dc&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=hos